  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "01f1c6fb7e57130284ddf050b9921524",
        "content": [
          "### Airbnb Guest Support Assistant instructions\n",
          "You are an Airbnb guest support assistant. Answer guest questions about bookings, cancellations, refunds, check-in/check-out, pricing, and general Airbnb support topics. If the answer is not found in the provided data sources, say so clearly and do not make up information. Be helpful, concise, and accurate.\n",
          "\n",
          "### Pol├¡tica de cancelamento do Airbnb\n",
          "Pol├¡tica de cancelamento: Reservas podem ser canceladas gratuitamente at├® 7 dias antes do check-in. Entre 7 dias e 24 horas antes do check-in, reembolso de 50%. Menos de 24 horas antes do check-in, n├úo h├í reembolso. O campo refund_status indica o status do reembolso: approved (aprovado), denied (negado), pending (pendente), not_applicable (n├úo aplic├ível).\n",
          "\n",
          "### Hor├írios de check-in e check-out\n",
          "Check-in ├® a partir das 15h. Check-out at├® ├ás 11h. Late check-out pode ser solicitado ao anfitri├úo. O campo check_in_date e check_out_date na tabela airbnb_bookings representam as datas de check-in e check-out respectivamente.\n",
          "\n",
          "### Status de reservas\n",
          "O campo booking_status na tabela airbnb_bookings pode ter os valores: confirmed (confirmada), cancelled (cancelada), completed (conclu├¡da), pending (pendente). Reservas pending aguardam processamento de pagamento.\n",
          "\n",
          "### Categorias de suporte\n",
          "O campo category na tabela airbnb_support_tickets pode ter os valores: booking, cancellation, refund, payment, check_in, check_out, property_issue, other. O campo status pode ser: open, in_progress, resolved, closed."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "example_question_sqls": [
      {
        "id": "01f1c6fc8d45194ea37169ee790a05bb",
        "question": [
          "Quais reservas foram canceladas com reembolso?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT booking_id, guest_name, property_name, check_in_date, total_amount, refund_amount, refund_status, cancellation_reason\n",
          "FROM workspace.default.airbnb_bookings\n",
          "WHERE booking_status = 'cancelled'\n",
          "ORDER BY check_in_date DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1c6fc8d451cedaa243aa14cd70557",
        "question": [
          "Qual o valor total de reembolsos aprovados?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT SUM(refund_amount) AS total_refunded, COUNT(*) AS num_refunds\n",
          "FROM workspace.default.airbnb_bookings\n",
          "WHERE refund_status = 'approved'"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1c6fc8d451fd89330ab9b561e503e",
        "question": [
          "Quais tickets de suporte est├úo em aberto?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT ticket_id, guest_name, category, priority, subject, description, created_at\n",
          "FROM workspace.default.airbnb_support_tickets\n",
          "WHERE status IN ('open', 'in_progress')\n",
          "ORDER BY CASE priority WHEN 'urgent' THEN 1 WHEN 'high' THEN 2 WHEN 'medium' THEN 3 ELSE 4 END, created_at DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1c6fc8d4612b49d0921f71a125a4f",
        "question": [
          "Reservas por cidade e valor m├®dio"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT property_city, COUNT(*) AS num_reservas, AVG(nightly_price) AS preco_medio_noite, SUM(total_amount) AS receita_total\n",
          "FROM workspace.default.airbnb_bookings\n",
          "GROUP BY property_city\n",
          "ORDER BY receita_total DESC"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
